inecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#3BAF4A]" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Household: &#x27;How long will my tokens last? Which appliances should I turn off?&#x27;</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#3BAF4A]" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Operator: &#x27;Which nodes are at risk in the next 24 hours?&#x27;</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#3BAF4A]" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Responds in English, Shona, or Ndebele based on user language</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#3BAF4A]" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Uses live node data — never makes up statistics</li></ul></div><div class="lg:order-1"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(26,43,28,0.12)] ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#F4F7F4] px-4 py-3 border-b border-[#E3EDE3]"><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-400"></span><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span><div class="ml-3 flex-1 rounded-lg bg-white px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-[#9EB09F]">app.gridubuntu.com/portal/[nodeId]</div></div><div class="relative w-full" style="aspect-ratio:16/10"><img alt="AI energy advisor chat interface" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="object-cover object-top" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 50vw" src="/ai-advisor.png"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#F4F7F4] px-6 py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="mb-12 text-center"><p class="mb-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">Under the Hood</p><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Everything else that makes it work</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]">The four screenshotted features above are just the visible surface. Behind them sits a set of purpose-built systems that keep the network reliable, fair, and secure around the clock.</p></div><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#F5A623]/15 text-[#D97706]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Automated EMS Rules Engine</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Token balance → 0: relay cuts in &lt;2 seconds</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Watt limit exceeded: relay trips, auto-restores in 60 s</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Battery &lt; 20%: emergency caps activate fleet-wide</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>All events written to immutable audit log</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#F5A623]/15 text-[#D97706]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-dollar-sign" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Finance &amp; Token Management</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Revenue dashboard: today / week / month / all-time</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>30-day revenue trend with community breakdown</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Full paginated transaction ledger + CSV export</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>EcoCash webhook for automatic token crediting</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#5A6E5C]/15 text-[#5A6E5C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-settings" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.671 4.136a2.34 2.34 0 0 1 4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1 2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0 3.831 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.32-1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33-4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0-3.831A2.34 2.34 0 0 1 6.35 6.051a2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319-1.915"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Live System Configuration</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>8 setting categories: tariff, EMS, payments, AI, security…</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Changes take effect immediately — no restarts</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Settings cache refreshes automatically every 5 min</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Per-section save with full audit trail</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wifi" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20h.01"></path><path d="M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0"></path><path d="M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0"></path><path d="M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">ESP32 Hardware Nodes</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>SCT-013 CT clamp for non-invasive current sensing</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Sonoff / Shelly relay for remote power control</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Local flash storage fallback during outages</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]"></span>Sub-2-second relay response to EMS commands</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white px-6 py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1A2B1C] to-[#2D4A2F] px-8 py-14 text-center text-white shadow-2xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Ready to see it live?</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-[#9EB09F]">Grid Ubuntu is currently in active pilot deployment. If you represent an organisation interested in evaluation, partnership, or co-deployment, we&#x27;ll walk you through a full live demo of the system.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#3BAF4A] px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#3BAF4A]/30 hover:bg-[#2D9039]" href="/contact">Request a Demo <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section>